{"1862300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catch The Train", "steam_appid": 1862300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The storm never stops. Neither can you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch The Train is online co-op survival for 1 to 4 players: crew a steam train, feed its passengers, and outrun the storm that ends the world. Reach the terminus with your passage earned and your crew alive, or find out how far you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run the train by hand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throttle, coal, switches, repairs: nothing on this train happens unless a crewmate does it. Push the engine too hard and it blows, and someone climbs out into the cold to fix it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b4499ff3b394245ebb395f7a408edce6.poster.avif?t=1788119283\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b4499ff3b394245ebb395f7a408edce6.webm?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b4499ff3b394245ebb395f7a408edce6.mp4?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook, serve, get paid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop, cook, and plate meals for hungry passengers in a rolling kitchen. Serve fast and fresh to build a streak, serve late and they get mad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/5590ef8b30a8219523e171f26d461fb0.poster.avif?t=1788119283\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/5590ef8b30a8219523e171f26d461fb0.webm?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/5590ef8b30a8219523e171f26d461fb0.mp4?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver everyone somewhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every passenger has a destination, and the switches will not throw themselves. The points you earn buy coal, ingredients, and everything else that keeps the run alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b9d7590acff99bdf6bfcbdc50be61d7e.poster.avif?t=1788119283\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b9d7590acff99bdf6bfcbdc50be61d7e.webm?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b9d7590acff99bdf6bfcbdc50be61d7e.mp4?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And do not stop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall behind and the storm swallows the train, the cars leak cold, and crewmates freeze solid in the snow. The longer the run goes, the faster it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/275a2b3e9673d7311b2d63fa267b930e.poster.avif?t=1788119283\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/275a2b3e9673d7311b2d63fa267b930e.webm?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/275a2b3e9673d7311b2d63fa267b930e.mp4?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring a crew</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to six through Steam lobbies, with proximity voice chat built in. Pick a crew class, paint your crewmate, and depart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends, load up the train, and don't look back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The storm never stops. Neither can you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch The Train is online co-op survival for 1 to 4 players: crew a steam train, feed its passengers, and outrun the storm that ends the world. Reach the terminus with your passage earned and your crew alive, or find out how far you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run the train by hand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throttle, coal, switches, repairs: nothing on this train happens unless a crewmate does it. Push the engine too hard and it blows, and someone climbs out into the cold to fix it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b4499ff3b394245ebb395f7a408edce6.poster.avif?t=1788119283\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b4499ff3b394245ebb395f7a408edce6.webm?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b4499ff3b394245ebb395f7a408edce6.mp4?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook, serve, get paid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop, cook, and plate meals for hungry passengers in a rolling kitchen. Serve fast and fresh to build a streak, serve late and they get mad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/5590ef8b30a8219523e171f26d461fb0.poster.avif?t=1788119283\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/5590ef8b30a8219523e171f26d461fb0.webm?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/5590ef8b30a8219523e171f26d461fb0.mp4?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver everyone somewhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every passenger has a destination, and the switches will not throw themselves. The points you earn buy coal, ingredients, and everything else that keeps the run alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b9d7590acff99bdf6bfcbdc50be61d7e.poster.avif?t=1788119283\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b9d7590acff99bdf6bfcbdc50be61d7e.webm?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/b9d7590acff99bdf6bfcbdc50be61d7e.mp4?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And do not stop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall behind and the storm swallows the train, the cars leak cold, and crewmates freeze solid in the snow. The longer the run goes, the faster it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/275a2b3e9673d7311b2d63fa267b930e.poster.avif?t=1788119283\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/275a2b3e9673d7311b2d63fa267b930e.webm?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/extras/275a2b3e9673d7311b2d63fa267b930e.mp4?t=1788119283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring a crew</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to six through Steam lobbies, with proximity voice chat built in. Pick a crew class, paint your crewmate, and depart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends, load up the train, and don't look back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A storm is closing in, and the only way out is forward. Grab your crew, keep the train moving, cook for hungry passengers, and make every decision count. Everyone has a role to play; there’s no room for mistakes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/376c836f7a2e0970380249866911a3d1f778d7d7/header.jpg?t=1788119283", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/daecce21e4cdc8f3e2651919f44ecdec50458948/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788119283", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862300/daecce21e4cdc8f3e2651919f44ecdec50458948/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788119283", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stro